  "question": {
    "html": "<p>During the nuclear fission of nucleus X into nucleus Y and nucleus Z, energy is released. The binding energies per nucleon of X, Y and Z are <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> , <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Y}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Z}\"></span> respectively. What is true about the binding energy per nucleon of X, Y and Z?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Y}\"></span> &gt; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Z}\"></span> &gt; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Y}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Z}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> &gt; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Y}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> &gt; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Z}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{X}\"></span> = <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Y}\"></span> + <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B_{Z}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
